<nav class="ref-letters yr-near" aria-label="Nearby years"><a href="/years/597-bce" aria-current="page">597 BCE</a><a href="/years/539-bce">539 BCE</a><a href="/years/480-bce">480 BCE</a><a href="/years/479-bce">479 BCE</a><a href="/years/404-bce">404 BCE</a></nav>
<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/march-16">16 March</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Nebuchadnezzar II captures Jerusalem</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/babylonian-chronicles">Babylonian Chronicle</a> records that <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nebuchadnezzar-ii">Nebuchadnezzar</a> took <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jerusalem">Jerusalem</a>, carried <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jehoiachin">King Jehoiachin</a> into exile and installed <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zedekiah">Zedekiah</a>. A revolt led to the city's destruction in 587 BCE.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nebuchadnezzar-ii">Nebuchadnezzar II</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jehoiachin">Jehoiachin</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-bi" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-bi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-bi">Battle of Bi</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Bi was fought in 597 BCE near the Yellow River in modern Henan, when King Zhuang of Chu defeated an army of Jin that had come to relieve the State of Zheng.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Siege</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/siege-of-jerusalem-597-bce">Siege of Jerusalem (597 BCE)</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Siege of Jerusalem in 597 BCE was the capture of Jerusalem by Nebuchadnezzar II of the Chaldean Empire after the kingdom of Judah rebelled.</p></div></li></ol></section>
